# Secrets and local environment
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc
**/.netrc
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.dockercfg
**/credentials
**/secrets
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
secrets.properties
local.properties

# CI and issue templates
**/*.md

# Legal notices must reach the shipped image: Apache-2.0 requires the licence
# text to travel with the binary, and the MIT notice for the TOON library is a
# condition of using it. Both are copied into the runtime image explicitly.
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
